#sol[设圆 $O$ 的半径为 $r$，$P O$ 和它的延长线交圆 $O$ 于 $C$ 和 $D$。依据割线定理，得
#step[$P A dot.c P B = P C dot.c P D ju$]
#step[$∵ P A = 6 dou$]
#step[$P B = P A + A B = 13 display(1 / 3) ju$]
#step[$P C = P O - C O = 12 - r dou$]
#step[$P D = P O + O D = 12 + r dou$]
#step[$∴ 6 times 13 display(1 / 3) = (12 - r)(12 + r) dou$]
#step[即#h(6em)$80 = 144 - r^2 ju$]
#step[#h(6em)$r^2 = 64 dou r = 8 ju$]
]
#answer-line[答：圆 $O$ 的半径为 8 厘米。]

